From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:40:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: STEINS;GATE 0 CG, sound and movie libraries

Instructions 10:1F / 10:1D / 10:20 run the original libraries (translated with
the phone). The CG viewer zoom is typed float, the sound library plays through
the original BGM channel request bridged to the engine BGM channels, and the
movie library draws the engine video player.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

